# Staged by fisher-5sg.9 on 2026-11-25. See README.md for derivation.
# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# (go, info, bestmove and quit), and the owner's 2026-11-25 D17 answers
# on fisher-5sg.10, recorded as fisher-r6y D49–D52 and D56.
# UCI position sets the side to move. Both commands have positive time.
> position startpos
> go wtime 10100 winc 100
# D49 and D56 allow any finished depths in order. D41 spells info.
# UCI bestmove requires one legal move. See README.md for D50 and the margin.
<* info depth {depth} multipv 1 score {score} nodes {nodes} nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< bestmove {legal}

> position startpos moves e2e4
> go btime 510 movestogo 1
# D49 and D56 allow any finished depths in order. D41 spells info.
# UCI bestmove requires one legal move. See README.md for D50 and the margin.
<* info depth {depth} multipv 1 score {score} nodes {nodes} nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< bestmove {legal}

# UCI quit and D25 require clean exit with no further output.
> quit
! exit
